  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.<br>• Halve potato and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat and arrange cut-side down. <br>• Bake until golden and tender, 40-45 mins</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee84bbf4d5de43bbeebf7/step-85725300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• Drain and rinse black beans.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Transfer garlic oil to a small heatproof bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season with salt and pepper to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee84bbf4d5de43bbeebf7/step-da0f6f10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When potatoes have 5 mins remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook carrot, onion and black beans until tender, 2-3 mins.<br>• Add tomato paste, spicy taco seasoning (spice blend is hot! Add less if you’re sensitive to heat), the stock powder and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. <br>• Stir in the salt, brown sugar and butter. Add the water and cook until thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee84bbf4d5de43bbeebf7/step-e83a5420.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, the honey and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.<br>• Divide jacket potatoes between plates. Top with spicy black beans and <br>garlic yoghurt.<br>• Serve with tomato salad.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fee84bbf4d5de43bbeebf7/step-85da4130.jpeg"
    }
  ]
